<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="2026 國民年金考前測驗練習，50題附詳解。">
<title>2026 國民年金考前測驗</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg:#f5f7fb;
  --panel:#ffffff;
  --text:#182033;
  --muted:#687087;
  --line:#dfe4ee;
  --primary:#3157d5;
  --primary-dark:#2444ad;
  --ok:#137a4a;
  --bad:#b42318;
  --warn:#8a5a00;
  --shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(31,45,75,.08);
}
* { box-sizing:border-box; }
body {
  margin:0;
  font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","Noto Sans TC","PingFang TC","Microsoft JhengHei",sans-serif;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);
}
button, select { font:inherit; }
button { cursor:pointer; }
.container { width:min(940px, calc(100% - 28px)); margin:0 auto; }
header {
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#18264d,#3157d5);
  color:#fff;
  padding:34px 0 28px;
}
header h1 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,42px); }
header p { margin:0; opacity:.9; line-height:1.7; }
.top-note {
  margin-top:14px;
  display:inline-block;
  padding:7px 10px;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);
  border-radius:10px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);
  font-size:14px;
}
main { padding:26px 0 46px; }
.card {
  background:var(--panel);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:18px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  padding:22px;
  margin-bottom:18px;
}
.controls {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:14px;
  align-items:end;
}
.control label {
  display:block;
  font-weight:700;
  margin-bottom:7px;
  font-size:14px;
}
select {
  width:100%;
  padding:11px 12px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:10px;
  background:#fff;
  color:var(--text);
}
.btn {
  border:0;
  border-radius:11px;
  padding:11px 16px;
  font-weight:800;
  background:var(--primary);
  color:#fff;
}
.btn:hover { background:var(--primary-dark); }
.btn.secondary { background:#eef2ff; color:#263d91; }
.btn.ghost { background:#fff; color:var(--text); border:1px solid var(--line); }
.btn:disabled { opacity:.45; cursor:not-allowed; }
.progress-wrap {
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:12px;
  margin-bottom:14px;
}
.progress {
  flex:1;
  height:10px;
  border-radius:999px;
  background:#e9edf5;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.progress > div {
  height:100%;
  background:var(--primary);
  width:0%;
  transition:width .25s ease;
}
.meta {
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:12px;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:14px;
  margin-bottom:12px;
}
.tag {
  display:inline-block;
  padding:5px 9px;
  border-radius:999px;
  background:#eef2ff;
  color:#2945a5;
  font-weight:800;
  font-size:13px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.question {
  font-size:clamp(20px,4vw,26px);
  line-height:1.55;
  font-weight:850;
  margin:0 0 18px;
}
.options {
  display:grid;
  gap:11px;
}
.option {
  width:100%;
  text-align:left;
  padding:14px 15px;
  border-radius:12px;
  border:1.5px solid var(--line);
  background:#fff;
  color:var(--text);
  line-height:1.55;
  transition:.15s ease;
}
.option:hover:not(:disabled) {
  border-color:#8aa0ea;
  transform:translateY(-1px);
}
.option .letter {
  display:inline-grid;
  place-items:center;
  width:28px;
  height:28px;
  border-radius:8px;
  margin-right:9px;
  background:#f0f3f9;
  font-weight:900;
}
.option.correct {
  border:2px solid var(--ok);
  background:#effaf5;
}
.option.wrong {
  border:2px solid var(--bad);
  background:#fff2f1;
}
.option.correct::after {
  content:"  ✓ 正確答案";
  color:var(--ok);
  font-weight:900;
}
.option.wrong::after {
  content:"  ✕ 你的答案";
  color:var(--bad);
  font-weight:900;
}
.explanation {
  margin-top:18px;
  border-left:5px solid var(--primary);
  background:#f8f9ff;
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:14px 16px;
  line-height:1.75;
}
.explanation strong { display:block; margin-bottom:4px; }
.nav {
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:12px;
  margin-top:18px;
}
.result {
  text-align:center;
  padding:10px 0;
}
.score {
  font-size:58px;
  font-weight:950;
  line-height:1;
  margin:10px 0;
}
.result-grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:10px;
  margin:18px 0;
}
.metric {
  background:#f7f8fc;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:12px;
  padding:14px 8px;
}
.metric b { font-size:22px; display:block; }
.review-item {
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:12px;
  padding:14px;
  margin-top:12px;
  line-height:1.65;
}
.review-item h3 { margin:0 0 8px; font-size:17px; }
.review-item .mine { color:var(--bad); font-weight:800; }
.review-item .right { color:var(--ok); font-weight:800; }
.sources {
  line-height:1.8;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:14px;
}
.sources a { color:var(--primary-dark); overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.small { color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; }
.hidden { display:none !important; }
kbd {
  border:1px solid #cad1df;
  border-bottom-width:2px;
  background:#fff;
  border-radius:5px;
  padding:1px 6px;
  font-size:12px;
}
@media (max-width:700px) {
  .controls { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .card { padding:17px; border-radius:15px; }
  .result-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; }
  .nav { flex-direction:column; }
  .nav .btn { width:100%; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>2026 國民年金考前測驗</h1>
    <p>50題選擇題｜作答後立即顯示答案與詳解｜支援錯題重練</p>
    <div class="top-note">資料基準：2026-08-17　考現行法時，請勿把修法草案當成已生效規定。</div>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="container">
  <section id="setup" class="card">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">開始練習</h2>
    <div class="controls">
      <div class="control">
        <label for="count">題數</label>
        <select id="count">
          <option value="10">10題快刷</option>
          <option value="20">20題練習</option>
          <option value="50" selected>50題完整測驗</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="control">
        <label for="order">題目順序</label>
        <select id="order">
          <option value="normal">依題庫順序</option>
          <option value="random">隨機出題</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <button class="btn" id="startBtn">開始測驗</button>
    </div>
    <p class="small" style="margin-bottom:0;margin-top:14px">桌機可用 <kbd>1</kbd>～<kbd>4</kbd> 選答案，<kbd>Enter</kbd> 下一題。</p>
  </section>

  <section id="quiz" class="card hidden" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="progress-wrap">
      <div class="progress" aria-label="作答進度"><div id="bar"></div></div>
      <b id="progressText">1 / 50</b>
    </div>
    <div class="meta">
      <span id="scoreText">目前答對：0</span>
      <span id="statusText">請作答</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tag" id="tag"></div>
    <h2 class="question" id="questionText"></h2>
    <div class="options" id="options"></div>
    <div id="explanation" class="explanation hidden"></div>
    <div class="nav">
      <button class="btn ghost" id="quitBtn">結束本回</button>
      <button class="btn" id="nextBtn" disabled>下一題</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="result" class="card hidden">
    <div class="result">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">本回完成</h2>
      <div class="score" id="finalPercent">0%</div>
      <div id="finalMessage"></div>
      <div class="result-grid">
        <div class="metric"><b id="correctCount">0</b>答對</div>
        <div class="metric"><b id="wrongCount">0</b>答錯</div>
        <div class="metric"><b id="totalCount">0</b>總題數</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <button class="btn" id="retryWrongBtn">錯題重練</button>
        <button class="btn secondary" id="restartBtn">重新開始</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="review"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="card sources">
    <h2 style="color:var(--text);margin-top:0">官方資料來源</h2>
    <p>本題庫依前述已核對的現行國民年金規定整理，並以 2026-08-17 為資料基準。若日後法規或給付金額修正，請再以官方最新公告為準。</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0050152" target="_blank" rel="noopener">全國法規資料庫－國民年金法</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.bli.gov.tw/0019853.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">勞保局－國民年金保險費率／月投保金額相關資料</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.bli.gov.tw/0013596.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">勞保局－國民年金保險費負擔比例</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.bli.gov.tw/0014336.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">勞保局－老年年金給付計算</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://dep.mohw.gov.tw/DOSI/cp-317-86447-102.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">衛福部－2026 老年年金免申請措施</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</main>

<script>
